WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Every answer.
Not every first choice.

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:06.700
In RecoScope’s November 22
electric-shaver snapshot,

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:09.200
Braun appeared in all 12 answers.

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:12.300
But only 3 of the 4 assistants
ranked it first.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:14.450
Claude ranked Panasonic first.

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:17.050
Philips Norelco appeared
in 11 answers,

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:18.650
and Panasonic in 10.

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:20.950
We captured 12 usable answers

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:23.940
across 4 AI assistants
and 3 prompt types.

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:26.200
Each fresh chat used the same

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.600
daily-shaving,
sensitive-skin profile.

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:30.350
Under $150,

00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:34.200
Braun and Philips Norelco
appeared in all 4 answers.

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:36.800
Mentions don’t verify
checkout prices.

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:38.400
This is a new baseline,

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:40.750
not a trend against
May’s different prompts.

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:43.800
Track visibility and
explicit ranks separately.

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:47.980
Captured answers don’t establish
product quality or clinical benefit.

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:51.170
Explore benchmark at
getrecoscope.com.
